{"id":"schon","lemma":"schon","pos":"adv","rank":40,"glosses":["already (happening rather early, continuing rather long)","previously, before (at some time in the past; but not: before a certain event)","expresses that an action has been completed; already (but more frequent); yet (in questions)"],"ipa":"/ʃoːn/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/c0/De-schon.ogg/De-schon.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Ist er schon zurück?","en":"Is he back already?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/394541","words":[{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"he / it"},null,{"g":"stand back!"}]},{"text":"Ich war schon im Bett.","en":"I was in bed already.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/566768","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"in the"},{"g":"bed (piece of furniture"}]},{"text":"Habt ihr diese Geschichte schon gehört?","en":"Have you already heard this story?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/745608","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"haben"},{"g":"you (pl.) / her"},{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},{"g":"history"},null,{"g":"to hear through the ear)","l":"hören"}]},{"text":"Wartet ihr schon lange?","en":"Have you been waiting for long?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/745542","words":[{"g":"to wait","l":"warten"},{"g":"you (pl.) / her"},null,{"g":"long, for a long time"}]},{"text":"Ich vermisse es schon.","en":"I miss it already.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/390527","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to miss","l":"vermissen"},{"g":"it"},null]}]}